{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach object, take it if in range and move to target location. Check object, perform task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsAtObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToTargetLocation    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    />",
